==Japanese==

===Etymology 1===
{{ja-kanjitab|yomi=on,kanyoon|りん|ご|alt=奈:obsolete rare,苹果:obsolete literary}}
{{swp|ja:リンゴ}}
{{swp|Apple}}
[[File:Red Apple.jpg|thumb|{{m|ja||林檎|tr=ringo}}]]

{{IPAchar|/rimʉɡomʉ/}} → {{IPAchar|/riŋɡõː/}} → {{IPAchar|/riŋɡo/}}

From {{der|ja|ltc|sort=りんこ|-}} {{ltc-l|林檎}}.

Originally referred to the [[Chinese pearleaf crabapple]] ({{taxfmt|Malus asiatica|species}}) imported from China, it has expanded to mean any apple of the ''[[Malus]]'' [[genus]].

First cited in 918 in the {{m|ja||本草和名|tr=Honzō Wamyō|Japanese names for medicinal plants}}.<ref name="KDJ">{{R:Kokugo Dai Jiten}}</ref>

====Pronunciation====
{{ja-pron|りんご|acc=0|acc_ref=DJR}}

====Noun====
{{ja-noun|りんご}}

# {{defdate|from 918}} [[apple]]
#: {{ja-x|'''りんご'''の[[鮮%度]]の[[見分ける|見%分け]][[方]]|'''りんご''' の せん%ど の み%わけ-かた|how to tell whether an '''apple''' is fresh}}
# {{lb|ja|slang}} the company {{w|Apple Inc.}} or its products
#: {{ja-x|[[よく]]'''林%檎'''の[[審%査]] [[通る|通った]]な[[これ]]。|よく '''りん%ご''' の しん%さ とおった な これ。|I can't believe this has passed '''Apple's''' censorship.}}

=====Usage notes=====
Can refer to either the [[fruit]] or the [[tree]]. {{U:ja:biology|リンゴ}}

